WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.284
India and Japan just swapped places.

00:00:02.454 --> 00:00:05.564
India is about nine times
bigger than Japan by area.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.840
Dropped into East Asia,
it would sit right off China's coast,

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.520
facing Korea and Russia.

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:14.845
Japan would land in South Asia,
a small island nation between Pakistan,

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:16.365
China and Bangladesh.

00:00:16.731 --> 00:00:19.121
Same countries,
completely different neighbours.

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:20.601
Which one would struggle more?

